# === ORGANIC #561: ECO timing repair TCL ===
# 4 OpenROAD workarounds for safe stand-alone ECO iteration:
#   (a) RSZ-0074: read post_hold.def, not routed.def
#   (b) Signal-11: pass-2 repair is setup-only (no repair_design)
#   (c) DRT-0305: PG net cleanup (zero_/one_ stubs) before global_route
#   (d) DPL-0033: catch around check_placement
# Generated by phase3_one_shot_runner._build_eco_repair_tcl
# Chip-AGNOSTIC: standard OpenROAD APIs only.

read_lef /foss/pdks/sky130A/libs.ref/sky130_fd_sc_hd/techlef/sky130_fd_sc_hd__nom.tlef
read_lef /foss/pdks/sky130A/libs.ref/sky130_fd_sc_hd/lef/sky130_fd_sc_hd.lef
read_liberty /foss/pdks/sky130A/libs.ref/sky130_fd_sc_hd/lib/sky130_fd_sc_hd__tt_025C_1v80.lib
